# Story time and reading order
#
# Two different clocks. Aputhiran's story is read in canto 14 and happens before canto 11.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m08_time> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Story time and reading order" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: time:Instant

iy:StoryPosition a owl:Class .
iy:ReadingPosition a owl:Class .

iy:storyTime a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:readingTime a owl:ObjectProperty .
